# Follow a person or pose (action: /autonomy/follow).

# goal
string task_id
FollowTarget target
builtin_interfaces/Duration time_allowance  # 0 = until canceled
---
# result
Error error
builtin_interfaces/Duration follow_duration
---
# feedback
FollowTarget active_target
float32 distance_to_target
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped current_pose
TaskState state
